gametitle=Klonoa 2: Lunatea's Veil (SLUS-20151) [2F56CBC9]

[Hard Mode]
author=Vinicius + Claude
description=Hard Mode v1.2 - Max HP 2, no boss comeback 1UPs, small hearts heal only 20% of the time (Double always heals; a failed heart at 1 HP plays a cue), start with 2 lives, max 4 lives, enemies and bosses 1.5x faster (AI, movement, projectiles, animation).
// Speed knobs (v1.2): TICK_MASK is the andi imm at 00266B88 and 00266BE8 (N=1 -> 1.5x default, 3 -> 1.25x, 7 -> 1.125x, 0 -> 2x). MASK_ENEMY 00266A38, FLAG_200A 00266A3C, MASK_BOSS 00266A40/00266A44, EXCL_LEVELS from 00266A48, EXCL_SPECIES from 00266A50 (lists end with FFFFFFFF).
// Speed cave lives in a dead function at 00266A30 (8 identical unreferenced copies in the ELF). Hooks: update loop 0x1A5C54, render passes 0x18DECC/0x18DF3C/0x18DFAC, anim advance 0x20E14C/0x20E180/0x20E1E0.
// Heal chance knob: word at 0032DF34 is 'addiu at,zero,N' (2401000N): heal when rng % N == 0. N=5 -> 20% (default), N=4 -> 25%, N=10 -> 10%.
// Fail-cue SFX knob: 64-bit id 000C80C85CA00400 is built by the 6 words at 0032DF70..0032DF84 (lui/ori/dsll/ori/dsll/ori; the 16-bit halves are the imm of words 1,2,4,6).
// Candidates to A/B: 000C80C85CA00400 (default), 004B04B05CA00401, 004B04B05CA00402, 004B04B01CA00303 (blue stone). Rebuild with build_hardmode.py to switch cleanly.
// RAM flag at 0032DFFC (zero in the original ELF, deliberately not patched here): set by the cave on a failed heart, consumed by the effect-queue stub (hook at 0x1D3A90) to skip the normal heart pickup sound 004B04B01CA00301.
